1
00:00:00,410 --> 00:00:01,660
(Howard:)Your call.

2
00:00:05,080 --> 00:00:06,380
(Bernadette:)Howard...

3
00:00:06,380 --> 00:00:10,550
(Bernadette:)have you ever considered us
living together?

4
00:00:10,550 --> 00:00:12,390
(Howard:)Boy, I don't know.

5
00:00:12,390 --> 00:00:15,860
(Howard:)You, me, Ma living
under the same roof?

6
00:00:15,860 --> 00:00:19,630
(Bernadette:)No, I mean just you and me.

7
00:00:19,630 --> 00:00:20,900
(Bernadette:)You can move in here,

8
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:22,830
(Bernadette:)or we can find a place.

9
00:00:22,830 --> 00:00:24,630
(Howard:)I've got a better solution.
What?

10
00:00:24,640 --> 00:00:26,700
(Howard:)We wait for my mom's heart
to explode

11
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:28,670
(Howard:)from all the salt she eats.

12
00:00:28,670 --> 00:00:31,040
(Howard:)Then we just stick her in
the ground, flip her mattress

13
00:00:31,040 --> 00:00:32,380
(Howard:)and move into the big bedroom.

14
00:00:32,380 --> 00:00:34,780
(Bernadette:)Great.

15
00:00:34,780 --> 00:00:38,780
(Howard:)Look at us planning
a future together!

16
00:00:44,350 --> 00:00:45,660
Who's there?!

17
00:00:45,660 --> 00:00:47,490
(Mrs Wolowitz(voice):)Are you a
sex criminal?!

18
00:00:49,460 --> 00:00:53,000
(Howard:)Sex criminals
don't have keys, Ma!

19
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:55,900
(Mrs Wolowitz:)Where were you
so late?!

20
00:00:55,900 --> 00:00:57,300
I was out with Bernadette!

21
00:00:57,300 --> 00:00:58,730
(Mrs Wolowitz:)I know what
that means!

